SUMMARY:The Labour Day Weekend Pub-Club and Dance! (Harp Tavern)
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello eveyone\,\n\nC
 ome celebrate the Labour Day long weekend with a night of drinks\, convers
 ation\, live music and dancing! We’ll begin at the new **Harp Tavern** o
 n Eglinton\, where everyone can meet\, grab a beer or cocktail\, and get t
 o know the group in a relaxed Irish-pub atmosphere. Then later we’ll hea
 d out together for a short walk to our **secret second location**\, where 
 we’ll turn up the energy with a live band\, music and dancing!\n\n\\*Joi
 ned by my other groups too\; so we can anticipate a fantastic evening!\n\n
 Event Details Below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\
 nEvent Details:\n**The Labour Day Weekend Pub-Club and Dance! (Harp Tavern
 )**\n\n**Hightlights:**\n\n* 🍺 Meet us between 9:00 PM and 10:00 PM at 
 The Harp Tavern\, 180 Eglinton Ave E\, Toronto.\n* 🍸 Start the evening 
 casually with beers\, cocktails\, conversation and a chance to meet some n
 ew people before we head out together.\n* 🎶 After we mix and mingle\, w
 e’ll walk as a group to our secret second location for live music\, a li
 ve band and dancing.\n* 💃 Come on your own or bring a friend. The idea 
 is simply to socialize\, have some laughs\, enjoy the long weekend and mak
 e it a fun Friday night out!\n\nHosted by Steve Flemming — Soul City Soc
 ial Club\n\n**Event fee:**\nPlease pay $10 cash at the event or in advance
  by e-transfer to [Steveflemming11@gmail.com](mailto:Steveflemming11@gmail
 .com)\n\\*one beverage and/or appetitzer minimum at first location-please 
 kindly support the second location too- Thank you!\n\n**Parking and Subway
 :**\n\\*You can find free parking on Eglinton and Mt. Pleasant north of Eg
 linton\n\\*Minutes walk from the Yonge and Eglinton subway too-even close 
 to Eglinton and Mt. Pleasant station
