SUMMARY:Port Credit Nature Walk with the Southside Shuffle Blues and Jazz 
 Festival
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 **\\*\\*Kindly Read Carefully\\*\\***\n\nPlease join me and my other group
 s as we enjoy a wonderful Saturday with a fun leisure walk through parts o
 f Port Credit and also check out some of the live Street performances as w
 ell.\nMany of us will return to our gathering place after our walk for din
 ner\, cold beverages and the sun set.\n\n\\*Arrive early if you like (howe
 ver we will meet out front at\n2:00 p.m. (we will wait for everyone to arr
 ive until roughly 2:30)\n\nWe will meet out side of **Stonehooker Brewing 
 Company\, 866 Lakeshore Road East Mississauga\, O**N **L5E 1E1.**\n\nThis 
 will give us an opportunity to introduce ourselves as everyone arrives\; t
 hen make our way on our small adventure out to Port Credit\, near the wate
 r and also to check out all the amazing live music during there annual blu
 es and jazz festival.\n\nEvent Details below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flem
 ming\n(Organizer)\n\n**Event Details:**\n**Port Credit Nature Walk with th
 e Southside Shuffle Blues and Jazz Festival**\n\n\\*We can stop and rest a
 t different spots\, bathroom breaks\, take some lovely scenic photos\, gro
 up shots and share some laughs\n\\*Check out some awesome live music durin
 g the walk (Many bands will be playing this afternoon)\n\\*Play a couple f
 un ice breaker games as well to help build some bonds\n\\*Great way to mak
 e new connections and build upon our existing friendships\n\\*Head for din
 ner and beverages after the walk and festival\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee:**\n10 dolla
 rs (cash only) when you arrive\nor e transfer in advance to Steveflemming1
 1@gmail.com\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\n\n**Time\, Parking and Location: Where to meet us?**\n\nWe will mee
 t out side of **Stonehooker Brewing Company\, 866 Lakeshore Road East Miss
 issauga\, O**N **L5E 1E1.**\n\n\\*Arrive early if you like (however we wil
 l meet out front at\n2:00 p.m. (we will wait for everyone to arrive until 
 roughly 2:30)\n\n**Parking Car when arriving:**\n\\*Park your cars behind 
 the Brewery (lots of parking) then meet us out front. Look for me (Steve) 
 and the group. (easy to find)\n(In between Dixie and Cawthra right on the 
 Lakeshore)\n\nGo Train will take you there by Union Station too :)\nFree p
 arking behind the Brewery :)\n\n\\*If you need a ride (leave a comment bel
 ow and someone might be in your neighbourhood)\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\nThanks for reading everyone\, remember to RSV
 P and see you real soon! :)\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-
